@startuml
title UML sequence - assisted call center session with customer authorization and channel policy (AT-22)
actor "Call center agent" as Agent
participant "bank-api" as API
participant "Controls" as C
actor Customer
participant "Core" as Core
Agent -> API : open session (CALL_CENTER, VERIFIED_CONTACT_CALLBACK, customer, purpose)
API -> C : open_assisted_session (assisted_service role; method permitted for channel)
C --> API : AWAITING_CUSTOMER (10 minutes)
Agent -> API : view accounts
API -> C : assisted_permits -> SESSION_NOT_ACTIVE (recorded)
API --> Agent : 403
Customer -> API : Allow assistance (own bank channel)
API -> C : authorize_assisted_session -> AUTHORIZED (15 minutes)
Agent -> API : view accounts / protective freeze
API -> C : authorize(staff actor, represented customer, assisted:<session>)
C -> C : assisted_permits: session live, parties match,\noperation confirmed for channel, customer's own account
C --> API : allowed (recorded with reason CHANNEL_POLICY)
API -> Core : restrict(debit blocked)
Customer -> API : quote a payment
API --> Customer : refused (common restriction)
Customer -> API : End assistance
API -> C : close_assisted_session -> CLOSED
Agent -> API : view accounts
API --> Agent : 403 (SESSION_NOT_ACTIVE)
note right of C : DRAFT_PAYMENT is enabled in no channel\nuntil DEC-09 confirms operations
@enduml
